ovides a flexible framework for integrating sensor data, planning algorithms, and control systems, enabling real-time interaction with the robot. URScript, the proprietary programming language, allows for direct control of the robot’s joints and end-effector, enabling complex motion sequences and task-specific programming. These software interfaces are essential for achieving the precision and adaptability required in industrial applications."
